  "result": "Perfect! All 146 tests pass, including 21 new payment tests. The payments module is now complete.\n\n**Summary of changes:**\n\n\u2705 **src/errors.js** \u2014 Added two new error codes:\n- `NOT_ISSUED`: Invoice has not been issued yet\n- `OVERPAYMENT`: Payment exceeds the amount owed\n\n\u2705 **src/payments.js** \u2014 New module with:\n- `recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })`: Records a payment on issued/partially_paid invoices\n  - Returns ok(newInvoice) with payment added to invoice.payments array\n  - Auto-creates payments array if missing\n  - Status becomes 'partially_paid' on first payment, 'paid' when balance is zero\n  - Validates amount is positive integer\n  - Prevents overpayments\n  - Refuses payment on draft or paid invoices\n- `balanceDue(invoice)`: Returns total owed minus payments already made (clamped at 0)\n\n\u2705 **test/payments.test.js** \u2014 21 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Balance calculations (no payments, one payment, multiple payments, overpaid)\n- Status validation (draft/paid rejection, issued/partially_paid acceptance)\n- Amount validation (non-integer, negative, zero, overpayment)\n- Status transitions (issued\u2192partially_paid\u2192paid, multiple payment accumulation)\n- Data integrity (no mutation, date storage, complex invoices with discount/VAT)\n\nAll 146 tests pass. The payment system integrates seamlessly with the existing invoice module using the result pattern and maintaining immutability.",
